# TextMeshPro font assets embed their whole SDF atlas as a raw hex blob inside the
# YAML, so Git's line-based text merge produces nonsense (conflict markers inside a
# serialized asset -> Unity fails to deserialize it). Treat them as binary and never
# let Git text-merge them; a conflict will leave the current branch's copy untouched.
Assets/Game/Art/Fonts/*SDF.asset binary